   the relation is the mechanism's registered falsifier-in-waiting.

3. Route elimination (data's own work; v1's running-coupling
   reading is KILLED by sign — corrected in place):
   amplitude ∝ 1/ln  →  tilt +2/L (blue)      — killed by sign
   incoherent (√L)   →  n_s = 0.9838 (+4.5σ) — excluded by data
   COHERENT (∝ ln)   →  n_s = 0.9677 — the sole survivor; the
   derivation target: one equal in-phase increment per decade of
