5. The two recorded forms: pipeline-frozen 0.9641 (-0.19σ) vs k-local 0.9677 (+0.66σ);
   the spread (+0.0036) is the k-local correction,
   recorded as consistency-check grade.

VERDICT: mechanism stays CANDIDATE (exhibited, not forced). On the
